e stencil is empty",   "grid_shape": "height = count(upper-left foreground), width = count(upper-right foreground)" } </annotation> </reference_puzzle>  <reference_puzzle rank="8" source="train" puzzle_id="0b148d64"> <similarity> score=1.0534 mechanism=1.0000 lexical=0.0100 code_feature=0.4286 overlap_tags=none </similarity> <paths> code=/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ARC1_code/train/0b148d64.py annotation=N/A </paths> <description> Extract the only quadrant whose foreground color differs from the other three.  Input structure: - The input is split into four black-separated quadrants. - Each quadrant contains sparse pixels of exactly one non-black color. - Three quadrants share one color and one quadrant has a unique color.  Rule: - Locate the first all-black separator row and column. - Compare the non-black color present in each quadrant. - Return the cropped contents of the uniquely colored quadrant.  Key insight: - The common-color quadrants are distractors; the answer is the outlier quadrant cropped down   to its non-black extent. </description> <annotation> No annotation JSON was found. </annotation> </reference_puzzle>  ## 必读参考代码路径  执行前请至少快速阅读这些文件的 `main()` 和 `generate_input()`，重点看它们如何避免退化输入、如何随机放置对象、如何验证隐式假设：  - `/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ARC_code/train/3ad05f52.py` - `/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ARC1_code/eval/fd096ab6.py` - `/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ARC_code/train/320afe60.py` - `/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ARC1_code/eval/2546ccf6.py` - `/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ARC_code/train/52364a65.py` - `/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ARC_code/train/df978a02.py` - `/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ARC_code/eval/f931b4a8.py` - `/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ARC1_code/train/0b148d64.py`  ## 公共参考工具箱  执行前还必须快速阅读 `/home/lixinyu/snap/new/solvers/arc_utils.py`。它是 ARC 公共工具箱，包含统一的 `(r, c)` 坐标约定、bbox、连通域、裁剪、几何变换、颜色和网格操作等公共实现。生成代码时优先参考或复用这些函数；若直接 import，请确保目标文件仍可被 `SourceFileLoader` 直接加载，自检命令能独立运行。  ## 实现要求  1. `main(grid)` 必须实现新题描述中的确定性转换规则，不能只识别 `generate_input()` 的固定模板。禁止不同的input网格输出相同的output网格。 2. `generate_input()` 必须随机生成多样